                        <!-- Recent changes -->
                        <h6 class="fw-bold mb-2">📋 What's New</h6>
                        <p class="mb-2"><strong>5/15/2026 (6)</strong></p>
                        <ul class="mb-2">
                            <li>🇺🇸 10 new US Federal Holidays — MLK Day, Presidents' Day, Memorial Day, Juneteenth, Labor Day, Indigenous Peoples' Day, and Veterans Day each have unique animations and are toggleable in the Seasons tab. Veterans Day (Nov 11) takes priority over UK Remembrance Day when enabled.</li>
                            <li>💐 3 new family holidays — Mothering Sunday (UK, Easter −21 days), Mother's Day (US, 2nd Sun May), Father's Day (US, 3rd Sun Jun), each with flower/celebration animations.</li>
                            <li>🇺🇸 Independence Day moved to the new <strong>US Federal Holidays</strong> section in the Seasons tab; July 4th animations now show fireworks 🎆, flag parade 🇺🇸, and soaring eagle 🦅.</li>
                            <li>🗓️ New <strong>Seasons tab</strong> in Settings — all 49 seasonal events in a clean list with date ranges, enable/disable toggles, and per-event test buttons grouped by category (Seasons, Major Holidays, US Federal, Family, British, Global &amp; Cultural, Niche / Pop Culture).</li>
                        </ul>
                        <p class="mb-2"><strong>5/15/2026 (4)</strong></p>
                        <ul class="mb-2">
                            <li>🪄 Lone Wolf Counter-Spell — after a non-consensus reveal, the outlier voter sees a <strong>🐔 Cast Spell</strong> button. Clicking it overlays all other participants with a bouncing chicken for a configurable duration (default 4s). Once per session. Enable/configure in Events settings.</li>
                        </ul>
                        <p class="mb-2"><strong>5/15/2026 (3)</strong></p>
                        <ul class="mb-2">
                            <li>👻 Ghost Mode — any participant can toggle ghost mode; latecomers who join mid-vote are marked as ghosts (watch only). A Teams-style info bar notifies all participants when the mode changes. Toggle button in room controls.</li>
                            <li>☕ Discussion Timer — after a non-consensus reveal, an optional countdown banner gives the team time to discuss before 🌋 Floor is Lava kicks in. Configurable duration in Events settings.</li>
                            <li>🎤 Voice-Activated Reveal — say a configurable trigger phrase (default: "reveal") to reveal votes hands-free. A 🎤 Listening badge appears in the navbar while active. Configurable phrase and language in Events settings. Works in Chrome/Edge.</li>
                        </ul>
                        <p class="mb-2"><strong>5/15/2026 (2)</strong></p>
                        <ul class="mb-2">
                            <li>🐇 Spring rabbit now hops in the correct direction.</li>
                            <li>▶ Per-season test buttons — click <strong>▶</strong> next to any of the 39 seasonal events in settings to preview its animation immediately.</li>
                            <li>🎯 Shame Spotlight settings now show a live inline preview of the badge glow and toast as you adjust the colour and message.</li>
                            <li>📋 Feature Plan 3.0 reorganised — v2.0 remaining features moved into the v3 pipeline; #17–20 formally marked Will Not Do.</li>
                        </ul>
                        <p class="mb-2"><strong>5/15/2026</strong></p>
                        <ul class="mb-2">
                            <li>🗓️ Seasonal expansion — 39 events now supported (was 8). New events include Lunar New Year, Diwali, Pi Day, Star Wars Day, Pride, Bonfire Night, Oktoberfest, Space Week, and more. Priority resolver picks the most specific active event when dates overlap. Settings panel reorganised into 5 groups (Seasons, Major Holidays, British, Global &amp; Cultural, Niche / Pop Culture) with ✓ All / ✗ None quick-toggles.</li>
                            <li>🧪 Individual test buttons for every celebration effect — Confetti, Fireworks, Balloons, Streak, Floor is Lava, Shame Spotlight, Avatar Battle, and Seasonal Animation each have their own 🧪 Test button in the Events settings tab.</li>
                            <li>🎉 Celebration tab renamed to <strong>Events</strong>.</li>
                            <li>🌋 Floor is Lava: configurable countdown duration and lava color (Events tab → 🌋 sub-panel). Lava glow now respects your chosen color across all themes.</li>
                            <li>🗓️ Seasonal Theme: per-season enable/disable toggles (Halloween, Christmas, New Year, Valentine's, Spring, Summer, Autumn, Thanksgiving) in the Events tab.</li>
                            <li>🎨 Event colors in Theme editor — Lava primary, Lava secondary, and Shame spotlight are now proper CSS variables available in both the Theme editor and Events tab.</li>
                            <li>🤖 RoboHash sets 3 (Robot Heads), 4 (Cats), and 5 (Humans) disabled — these returned blank images for many seeds. Robots and Monsters remain. Saved preferences auto-migrate.</li>
                            <li>🌋 Floor is Lava — when there's an outlier after reveal, their badge glows red and a 30-second countdown banner appears. When time runs out, a lava confetti burst fires. Toggle in Events settings.</li>
                            <li>🌡️ Anonymous Vibe Check — before voting, teammates can react with 🚀😱😴🤔💪🤷. Counts shown live; no names attached. Resets with votes.</li>
                            <li>🎨 DiceBear background color — optional color picker inside the DiceBear avatar panel; color baked into the preview and synced to the room.</li>
                            <li>🗓️ Seasonal Theme — when enabled, celebrations auto-use seasonal confetti colors and emojis (Halloween, Christmas, Spring, Summer, etc.). Toggle in Celebration settings.</li>
                            <li>🏆 Session Awards — after 2+ rounds a trophy button appears in Vote History. Click it to see four personality awards: The Anchor, The Lone Wolf, The Dreamer, and The Pragmatist.</li>
                            <li>🔥 Streak Bonus — consecutive consensus votes trigger an escalating celebration (Triple Consensus → Godlike!) with a golden toast and enhanced confetti/fireworks burst. Toggle in Celebration settings.</li>
                            <li>📦 Open Source Credits — full attributions added to the About tab and <code>OPEN-SOURCE-CREDITS.txt</code>.</li>
                            <li>⚔️ Avatar Battle Arena — animated fighter duel plays after votes are revealed. Each fighter wields a weapon scaled to their vote (dagger → broadsword → warhammer → trident → infinity gauntlet).</li>
                            <li>Battle settings in Celebration tab — toggle on/off, adjust speed (slow/normal/fast), and choose when battles fire (outlier only or every reveal).</li>
                            <li>Avatar picker: 🎲 Randomize button generates a fun random seed for quick browsing.</li>
                            <li>Shame spotlight settings: toggle the outlier highlight on/off, pick a custom color, and customize the toast message — in the Celebration tab.</li>
                            <li>Avatar: Upload a custom photo — auto-cropped and resized.</li>
                        </ul>
                        <p class="mb-2"><strong>5/14/2026</strong></p>
                        <ul class="mb-2">
                            <li>Participant avatars — colored initials circles appear next to every participant's name.</li>
                            <li>Avatar ring states — voted (solid outline), not voted (dimmed), observer (dashed), you (highlighted).</li>
                            <li>Avatar picker in Profile settings — choose Initials, DiceBear illustrated styles, RoboHash (robots/monsters/cats), or your Social profile photo.</li>
                            <li>Avatar changes sync in real time to all participants in the room.</li>
                            <li>Shame spotlight — after votes are revealed, the lone outlier's badge is highlighted with an animation.</li>
                        </ul>
                        <p class="mb-2"><strong>4/27/2026</strong></p>
                        <ul class="mb-2">
                            <li>Unified ⚙️ Settings modal — Theme, Celebration, Profile, and About all in one place.</li>
                            <li>Custom theme editor always available — customize from any theme, not just custom ones.</li>
                            <li>Vote history shown after each round (below participants).</li>
                            <li>Story import: paste a list of stories to add them all at once.</li>
                            <li>Skip vote (🚫) card option added to room controls.</li>
                            <li>Profile tab: change your name and observer mode directly from Settings.</li>
                            <li>Keyboard shortcut: number keys 1–9 to quickly select a vote card.</li>
                        </ul>
                        <p class="mb-2"><strong>4/27/2026</strong></p>
                        <ul class="mb-2">
                            <li>Unselecting your vote now resets it for you (no more stuck votes).</li>
                            <li>Participant badges now show correctly cleared/voted state for all users including yourself.</li>
                            <li>Confirmation dialogs added for estimate set changes and vote resets.</li>
                            <li>Participant badge border width and voted color now fully respond to the custom theme settings.</li>
                            <li>Custom theme editor completely redesigned — grouped sections, collapsible, with a live side preview.</li>
                            <li>Theme editor now exposes <strong>all</strong> color and style variables.</li>
                        </ul>
                        <p class="mb-2"><strong>3/4/2026</strong></p>
                        <ul class="mb-2">
                            <li>🎉 Consensus now triggers a full celebration — confetti, fireworks, and balloons!</li>
                            <li>All celebration effects are independently toggleable and fully configurable.</li>
                            <li>Confetti supports theme-matched colors, holiday modes, emoji, stars, snow, and custom colors.</li>
                            <li>Custom themes can now specify their own confetti colors in the theme builder.</li>
                            <li>Fixed a too-many-redirects issue for users on shared hosting.</li>
                        </ul>
                        <p class="mb-2"><strong>3/4/2026</strong></p>
                        <ul class="mb-0">
                            <li>Creating a new custom theme now starts with your current theme automatically.</li>
                            <li>You can now create, edit, save, import, and export custom themes.</li>
                            <li>Share room invite links more easily.</li>
                            <li>People joining from a link are guided to enter their name first.</li>
                            <li>Added a quick Recent Changes button in the top bar.</li>
                        </ul>
                        <!-- Open source credits -->
                        <h6 class="fw-bold mb-2 mt-4">📦 Open Source Credits</h6>
